// attack with no effect text, on all three ids. `effect` stays 0 — all three are NULL —
// which is what keeps the `printings − abilitiesJson = 13` attack-gate identity closed.
// 🆕 D345 — **239 → 245 / 252 → 258**, +6 on BOTH: all six Cursed Blast printings
// carry an `abilities_json` (193 chars on Dusclops, 194 on Dusknoir) AND an
// `attacks_json` (65 / 160), every one non-zero, and `effect IS NULL` on all six —
// re-queried on the remote D1 with each row's own `length()`s and `IS NULL` in the
